  }
  .entry-item {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .metadata {
    font-size: 0.9em;
    color: #555;
    margin-top: 5px;
  }
  .signature {
    margin-top: 50px;
    font-size: 0.9em;
    text-align: right;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <p>1. "<span data-field="quote_text">{{ quote_text }}</span> The <span data-field="source_publication">{{ source_publication }}</span>, <span data-field="date">{{ date }}</span>.</p>

  <h2 class="section-title">Articles in Preparation</h2>
  <div class="entry-item">
    <p><span data-field="article_title">{{ article_title }}</span>, drafting.</p>
  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title">Grant Reports as External Reviewer</h2>
  <div class="entry-item">
    <p>Report written on "<span data-field="report_title_1">{{ report_title_1 }}</span>", <span data-field="grant_source_1">{{ grant_source_1 }}</span> grant, <span data-field="date_1">{{ date_1 }}</span>.</p>
    <p>Report written on "<span data-field="report_title_2">{{ report_title_2 }}</span>", <span data-field="grant_source_2">{{ grant_source_2 }}</span>, <span data-field="date_2">{{ date_2 }}</span>.</p>
    <p><span data-field="report_title_3">{{ report_title_3 }}</span> grant, <span data-field="date_3">{{ date_3 }}</span>.</p>
  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title">Encyclopedia Entries</h2>
  <div class="entry-item">
    <p>6. "<span data-field="encyclopedia_entry_1">{{ encyclopedia_entry_1 }}</span>", in <span data-field="encyclopedia_source_1">{{ encyclopedia_source_1 }}</span>, <span data-field="pages_1">{{ pages_1 }}</span>, <span data-field="publisher_1">{{ publisher_1 }}</span>, <span data-field="year_1">{{ year_1 }}</span>.</p>
    <p>5. "<span data-field="encyclopedia_entry_2">{{ encyclopedia_entry_2 }}</span>", in <span data-field="encyclopedia_source_2">{{ encyclopedia_source_2 }}</span>, <span data-field="pages_2">{{ pages_2 }}</span>, <span data-field="publisher_2">{{ publisher_2 }}</span>, <span data-field="year_2">{{ year_2 }}</span>.</p>
    <p>4. "<span data-field="encyclopedia_entry_3">{{ encyclopedia_entry_3 }}</span>", in <span data-field="encyclopedia_source_3">{{ encyclopedia_source_3 }}</span>, <span data-field="pages_3">{{ pages_3 }}</span>, <span data-field="publisher_3">{{ publisher_3 }}</span>, <span data-field="year_3">{{ year_3 }}</span>.</p>
    <p>3. "<span data-field="encyclopedia_entry_4">{{ encyclopedia_entry_4 }}</span>", in <span data-field="encyclopedia_source_4">{{ encyclopedia_source_4 }}</span>, edited by <span data-field="editor_1">{{ editor_1 }}</span>, <span data-field="pages_4">{{ pages_4 }}</span>, <span data-field="publisher_4">{{ publisher_4 }}</span>, <span data-field="year_4">{{ year_4 }}</span>.</p>
    <p>2. "<span data-field="encyclopedia_entry_5">{{ encyclopedia_entry_5 }}</span>", in <span data-field="encyclopedia_source_5">{{ encyclopedia_source_5 }}</span>, edited by <span data-field="editor_2">{{ editor_2 }}</span>, <span data-field="pages_5">{{ pages_5 }}</span>, <span data-field="publisher_5">{{ publisher_5 }}</span>, <span data-field="year_5">{{ year_5 }}</span>.</p>
    <p>1. "<span data-field="encyclopedia_entry_6">{{ encyclopedia_entry_6 }}</span>", in <span data-field="encyclopedia_source_6">{{ encyclopedia_source_6 }}</span>, edited by <span data-field="editor_3">{{ editor_3 }}</span>, <span data-field="pages_6">{{ pages_6 }}</span>, <span data-field="publisher_6">{{ publisher_6 }}</span>, <span data-field="year_6">{{ year_6 }}</span>.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 class="section-title">GRANTS & SUPPORT</h2>
  <div class="entry-item">
    <p>(E# refers to External grant, number received)</p>
    <p>33. <span data-field="grant_item_1">{{ grant_item_1 }}</span>, <span data-field="amount_1">{{ amount_1 }}</span>, <span data-field="date_grant_1">{{ date_grant_1 }}</span>.</p>
    <p>32. <span data-field="grant_item_2">{{ grant_item_2 }}</span> grant to support "<span data-field="project_title_1">{{ project_title_1 }}</span>, Step 1 of 2," awarded <span data-field="amount_2">{{ amount_2 }}</span> for SOPHIA, <span data-field="date_grant_2">{{ date_grant_2 }}</span>. E13</p>
    <p>31. <span data-field="grant_item_3">{{ grant_item_3 }}</span> mini-grant to support "<span data-field="project_title_2">{{ project_title_2 }}</span>", awarded <span data-field="amount_3">{{ amount_3 }}</span> in <span data-field="date_grant_3">{{ date_grant_3 }}</span>. E12</p>
    <p>30. <span data-field="grant_item_4">{{ grant_item_4 }}</span>, <span data-field="institution_1">{{ institution_1 }}</span>, <span data-field="date_grant_4">{{ date_grant_4 }}</span> for August 2015 travel.</p>
    <p>29. <span data-field="grant_item_5">{{ grant_item_5 }}</span>, from <span data-field="funding_body_1">{{ funding_body_1 }}</span>, which is funded by the <span data-field="funding_body_2">{{ funding_body_2 }}</span>, to participate in their writing workshop prior to the <span data-field="event_name_1">{{ event_name_1 }}</span> in <span data-field="location_1">{{ location_1 }}</span>, <span data-field="date_grant_5">{{ date_grant_5 }}</span>. E11</p>
    <p>28. <span data-field="grant_item_6">{{ grant_item_6 }}</span>, UM College of Liberal Arts, in support of the publication of <span data-field="publication_title_1">{{ publication_title_1 }}</span>, <span data-field="date_grant_6">{{ date_grant_6 }}</span>.</p>
    <p>27. <span data-field="grant_item_7">{{ grant_item_7 }}</span>, UM, for trip to the <span data-field="institution_2">{{ institution_2 }}</span>, in <span data-field="location_2">{{ location_2 }}</span>, <span data-field="date_grant_7">{{ date_grant_7 }}</span>. E10</p>
    <p>26. <span data-field="grant_item_8">{{ grant_item_8 }}</span>, <span data-field="institution_3">{{ institution_3 }}</span>, for travel to the <span data-field="institution_4">{{ institution_4 }}</span>, <span data-field="location_3">{{ location_3 }}</span>, <span data-field="date_grant_8">{{ date_grant_8 }}</span>.</p>
    <p>25. <span data-field="grant_item_9">{{ grant_item_9 }}</span> of <span data-field="amount_4">{{ amount_4 }}</span> for SOPHIA's 2014 events, plus matching funds from the <span data-field="institution_5">{{ institution_5 }}</span>. E9</p>
    <p>24. <span data-field="grant_item_10">{{ grant_item_10 }}</span> with the <span data-field="institution_6">{{ institution_6 }}</span> for Racial Reconciliation on the "<span data-field="project_title_3">{{ project_title_3 }}</span>", <span data-field="date_grant_9">{{ date_grant_9 }}</span> for work through the summer of 2014.</p>
    <p>23. <span data-field="grant_item_11">{{ grant_item_11 }}</span>, support to travel to <span data-field="institution_7">{{ institution_7 }}</span>.</p>
    <p>22. <span data-field="grant_item_12">{{ grant_item_12 }}</span> from the <span data-field="institution_8">{{ institution_8 }}</span>, for <span data-field="date_grant_10">{{ date_grant_10 }}</span>.</p>
    <p>21. <span data-field="grant_item_13">{{ grant_item_13 }}</span>, for summer <span data-field="year_7">{{ year_7 }}</span>.</p>
    <p>20. <span data-field="grant_item_14">{{ grant_item_14 }}</span> for SOPHIA activities in <span data-field="year_8">{{ year_8 }}</span>, <span data-field="amount_5">{{ amount_5 }}</span>, plus <span data-field="amount_6">{{ amount_6 }}</span> match. E8</p>
    <p>19. <span data-field="grant_item_15">{{ grant_item_15 }}</span> for a Fall 2013 SOPHIA symposium, <span data-field="amount_7">{{ amount_7 }}</span> plus <span data-field="amount_8">{{ amount_8 }}</span> match. E7</p>
    <p>18. <span data-field="grant_item_16">{{ grant_item_16 }}</span> for a <span data-field="year_9">{{ year_9 }}</span> summer.</p>
    <p>17. <span data-field="grant_item_17">{{ grant_item_17 }}</span> to support SOPHIA for <span data-field="year_10">{{ year_10 }}</span>, <span data-field="amount_9">{{ amount_9 }}</span>, <span data-field="date_grant_11">{{ date_grant_11 }}</span>.</p>
    <p>16. <span data-field="grant_item_18">{{ grant_item_18 }}</span>, <span data-field="amount_10">{{ amount_10 }}</span> for travel to the <span data-field="institution_9">{{ institution_9 }}</span> for an "<span data-field="event_name_2">{{ event_name_2 }}</span>" panel on my <span data-field="topic_1">{{ topic_1 }}</span>, in <span data-field="location_4">{{ location_4 }}</span>, <span data-field="date_grant_12">{{ date_grant_12 }}</span>.</p>
    <p>15. <span data-field="grant_item_19">{{ grant_item_19 }}</span>, <span data-field="amount_11">{{ amount_11 }}</span> plus <span data-field="amount_12">{{ amount_12 }}</span> matching funds, <span data-field="date_grant_13">{{ date_grant_13 }}</span>.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="signature">
    Eric Thomas Weber, Visiting Associate Professor of Philosophy,
    <br>
    The University of Kentucky, Curriculum Vitae, page 10
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 class="section-title">PRESENTATIONS</h2>
  <div class="entry-item">
    <p>118. <span data-field="presentation_item_1">{{ presentation_item_1 }}</span> (tentative title), <span data-field="invited_speaker_1">{{ invited_speaker_1 }}</span>, <span data-field="event_name_3">{{ event_name_3 }}</span>, <span data-field="location_5">{{ location_5 }}</span>, <span data-field="date_presentation_1">{{ date_presentation_1 }}</span>.</p>
    <p>117. <span data-field="presentation_item_2">{{ presentation_item_2 }}</span>, <span data-field="invited_speaker_2">{{ invited_speaker_2 }}</span>, <span data-field="event_name_4">{{ event_name_4 }}</span>, <span data-field="date_presentation_2">{{ date_presentation_2 }}</span>, <span data-field="location_6">{{ location_6 }}</span>.</p>
    <p>116. <span data-field="presentation_item_3">{{ presentation_item_3 }}</span>, <span data-field="event_name_5">{{ event_name_5 }}</span>, <span data-field="location_7">{{ location_7 }}</span>, <span data-field="date_presentation_3">{{ date_presentation_3 }}</span>.</p>
    <p>115. <span data-field="presentation_item_4">{{ presentation_item_4 }}</span>, <span data-field="invited_speaker_3">{{ invited_speaker_3 }}</span>, <span data-field="event_name_6">{{ event_name_6 }}</span>, <span data-field="location_8">{{ location_8 }}</span>, <span data-field="date_presentation_4">{{ date_presentation_4 }}</span>.</p>
    <p>114. <span data-field="presentation_item_5">{{ presentation_item_5 }}</span>, <span data-field="event_name_7">{{ event_name_7 }}</span>, <span data-field="location_9">{{ location_9 }}</span>, <span data-field="date_presentation_5">{{ date_presentation_5 }}</span>.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="signature">
    Eric Thomas Weber, Visiting Associate Professor of Philosophy,
    <br>
    The University of Kentucky, Curriculum Vitae, page 11
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="entry-item">
    <p>113. <span data-field="presentation_item_6">{{ presentation_item_6 }}</span>, <span data-field="invited_speaker_4">{{ invited_speaker_4 }}</span>, <span data-field="event_name_8">{{ event_name_8 }}</span>, <span data-field="location_10">{{ location_10 }}</span>, <span data-field="date_presentation_6">{{ date_presentation_6 }}</span>.</p>
    <p>112. <span data-field="presentation_item_7">{{ presentation_item_7 }}</span>, <span data-field="event_name_9">{{ event_name_9 }}</span>, <span data-field="location_11">{{ location_11 }}</span>, <span data-field="date_presentation_7">{{ date_presentation_7 }}</span>.</p>
    <p>109. <span data-field="presentation_item_8">{{ presentation_item_8 }}</span>, <span data-field="event_name_10">{{ event_name_10 }}</span> (with <span data-field="author_1">{{ author_1 }}</span>), and a <span data-field="event_name_11">{{ event_name_11 }}</span>: A Conversation about 'It's Over Debbie', a SOPHIA Workshop, <span data-field="date_presentation_8">{{ date_presentation_8 }}</span>, <span data-field="location_12">{{ location_12 }}</span>, <span data-field="date_presentation_9">{{ date_presentation_9 }}</span>, respectively.</p>
    <p>108. <span data-field="presentation_item_9">{{ presentation_item_9 }}</span>, <span data-field="event_name_12">{{ event_name_12 }}</span>, <span data-field="location_13">{{ location_13 }}</span>, <span data-field="date_presentation_10">{{ date_presentation_10 }}</span>.</p>
    <p>107. <span data-field="presentation_item_10">{{ presentation_item_10 }}</span>, <span data-field="invited_speaker_5">{{ invited_speaker_5 }}</span>, <span data-field="event_name_13">{{ event_name_13 }}</span>, <span data-field="location_14">{{ location_14 }}</span>, <span data-field="date_presentation_11">{{ date_presentation_11 }}</span>.</p>
    <p>106. <span data-field="presentation_item_11">{{ presentation_item_11 }}</span>, <span data-field="invited_speaker_6">{{ invited_speaker_6 }}</span> for the <span data-field="event_name_14">{{ event_name_14 }}</span> meeting at the <span data-field="location_15">{{ location_15 }}</span>, <span data-field="date_presentation_12">{{ date_presentation_12 }}</span>.</p>
    <p>105. <span data-field="presentation_item_12">{{ presentation_item_12 }}</span>, <span data-field="invited_speaker_7">{{ invited_speaker_7 }}</span> at the <span data-field="institution_10">{{ institution_10 }}</span>, <span data-field="location_16">{{ location_16 }}</span>, <span data-field="date_presentation_13">{{ date_presentation_13 }}</span>.</p>
    <p>104. <span data-field="presentation_item_13">{{ presentation_item_13 }}</span>, <span data-field="invited_speaker_8">{{ invited_speaker_8 }}</span>, <span data-field="institution_11">{{ institution_11 }}</span>, <span data-field="location_17">{{ location_17 }}</span>, <span data-field="date_presentation_14">{{ date_presentation_14 }}</span>.</p>
